  "inline_comments": [],
  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "[by Claude Code] Thanks @hshrivastava-droid! The cookbook update for the GLM-5.2 FP8 B300 agentic recipe from [InferenceX #3836](https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX/pull/3836) will be done in #43983 instead. That PR mirrors the InferenceX PR's current head (`3120bc1b`) into the GLM-5.2 page's Agentic Long-Context Deployment section. It adds c20/c24/c28 to the existing c1–c16 points, with the same EAGLE depths and the 270 GB/rank HiCache pool, and leaves the Deployment panel config unchanged. Closing this PR in favor of #43983.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-13T04:53:24Z",
